<title>USA: SMITHKLINE NAMES U'PRICHARD RESEARCH CHIEF.</title>
<headline>SMITHKLINE NAMES U'PRICHARD RESEARCH CHIEF.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>SmithKline Beecham Plc said Wednesday it had appointed Dr. David U'Prichard, 49, chairman of pharmaceuticals research and development.</p>
<p>The London-based company said U'Prichard, international research director for Zeneca Group Plc since 1994, would succeed Dr. George Poste who was named SmithKline's chief science and technology officer earlier this year.</p>
<p>(( New York Newsdesk 212 859-1736))</p>
